tests/fixtures/*.txt | Apache-2.0 | text fixtures: output of our own tools
tools/cts/*-tree.txt | Apache-2.0 | test lists, results of our board runs
tools/cts/*-mustpass.txt | Apache-2.0 | case-name lists derived from the VK-GL-CTS mustpass lists (Apache-2.0)
tools/cts/*.results.tsv | Apache-2.0 | our board run results
