tools/testdata/*.uart.ts | Apache-2.0 | UART captures of our board runs
tools/testdata/*.console.txt | Apache-2.0 | console captures of our board runs
tools/hostharness/allow.txt | Apache-2.0 | our allowlist table
tools/pvr/km/records.sha256 | Apache-2.0 | hashes of our records
driver/samples/zephyr/cluster/font-sizes.txt | Apache-2.0 | our measurement table
third_party/mesa-26.2.1/src/util/softfloat.c | BSD-3-Clause | Berkeley SoftFloat 3e: the file header is the BSD 3-clause text
third_party/mesa-26.2.1/src/util/softfloat.h | BSD-3-Clause | Berkeley SoftFloat 3e: the file header is the BSD 3-clause text
third_party/mesa-26.2.1/src/util/xxhash.h | BSD-2-Clause | xxHash: the file header says "BSD 2-Clause License"
driver/src/pvr/generated/csbgen/rogue/*.h | MIT | output of Mesa csbgen from Mesa XML (MIT text in the file, NOTICE 1a); check.sh regenerates it, so no edit
driver/src/v3d/generated/util/format/u_format_gen.h | MIT | output of Mesa u_format_table.py (MIT text in the file, NOTICE 1b); check.sh regenerates it
driver/src/v3d/generated/v3d_packet_v42_pack.h | MIT | output of Mesa gen_pack_header.py from v3d_packet.xml (UPSTREAM generated:, NOTICE 1b); check.sh regenerates it
include/KHR/khrplatform.h | MIT | Khronos header; the licence text in the file is the MIT text (NOTICE 6)
driver/rust/src/soc/imx8mp/regs.rs | generated-ok | NXP register data (BSD-3-Clause, NOTICE 10) through our Apache-2.0 generator
src/pvr/csbgen.rs | generated-ok | bindgen over Mesa csbgen output (MIT, NOTICE 1a) via yakogl-tools
driver/src/pvr/generated/csbgen_wrap.c | generated-ok | bindgen over Mesa csbgen output (MIT, NOTICE 1a) via yakogl-tools
